# Text files are LF in this repository, on every platform.
#
# Five files were committed with CRLF between 2026-10-06 and 2026-10-07 because
# they were written from a Windows checkout. That is what turned a six-row
# correction in data/anonymous-vms.json into a 988-line diff: every line changed
# because its line ending did, and a diff that size is a diff nobody reads. It
# will happen again to the next writer unless the boundary is mechanical.
#
# `text=auto` normalises on checkin; `eol=lf` pins what lands in the working
# tree, so a Windows clone does not re-introduce the same problem locally.
# `verify/pages/` is not listed: it is gitignored and holds third-party HTML
# captured byte-for-byte, which must not be rewritten by a checkout.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.gz  binary
